# Animation Guidelines

- Prefer `transform` and `opacity` for 60fps motion
- Gate animations when `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`
- Shared variants/easing live in `src/lib/` once defined
- Horizontal scroll: coordinate motion with scroll axis (x), not only y

## Avoid

- Animating layout properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`) on large panels
- Adding motion libraries beyond Framer Motion unless explicitly requested
